<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cemenco in talks on non-core assets sale.</title>
<headline>Cemenco in talks on non-core assets sale.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cementation Co (Africa) Ltd said on Wednesday it was in talks regarding the disposal of certain non-core assets.</p>
<p>The company urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
